            <ArticleTitle>Myoglobin concentration, creatine kinase, and creatine kinase sub-unit B activity in serum after myocardial ischaemia.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>679-82</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The myoglobin concentration, creatine kinase and creatine kinase sub-unit B activity were estimated in fourteen patients with ischaemic heart disease before and after exercise induced angina pectoris. No changes in these parameters were found.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
